  "id": 1400,
  "description": "**Apex Protocol\nEfficiency** is our standard. We are a goal-oriented collective focused on maximizing progress through consistent, active play.\n-\n* Requirement: **Mandatory contribution to Guild Challenges.** \n * Nightly Raids: 8PM and 9PM EST.\n * **Must be combat level 25 to apply.** \n * Items placed in the stockpile will count towards activity. All items go towards building and maintaining the Guild Hall. \n * Protocol: **Members inactive (no guild contribution) for 5 straight days will be decommissioned** (You can always re-apply if room is available). \n * Discord: **https://discord.gg/UnMzezMR5x** (Not Mandatory)\n * Energizing Pool every **Friday, Saturday, and Sunday from 7pm to 10pm EST** \n\n* Join the sequence. Reach the Apex.\n\n\nCurrent Guild Hall Goal\n-\n\n * **New Slot To Make: Armory** \n\nGuild Achievements\n-\n * Guild Hall ✔️\n * Mission Table ✔️\n * Unity Seal ✔️\n * Raid Planner ✔️\n * Energizing Pool ✔️",
